# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets — never commit, at any level of the tree
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The anon key is public by design, but the SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY used by the ML
# service is not, and both live in .env files. Committing one to a public repo
# would hand over write access to verdicts and confidence — the exact thing the
# column grants exist to prevent.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
credentials.json
token.json
*.pem
*.key

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dependencies and build output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
dist/
dist-ssr/
*.local
.vercel/
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ML artefacts — regenerated, and far too large for git
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.onnx
*.pt
*.pth
ml/models/
ml/.cache/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Scratch
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.tmp/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Large binaries — excluded to keep the repo to what is needed to RUN the app
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOTE, and it matters: these are NOT backed up anywhere else once excluded.
#
#   data/**                 20 MB. The 59 spike photos behind the 54% rank-1
#                           figure in spike/FINDINGS.md, plus pilot photos to
#                           come. Keep a copy in Drive — a measured claim whose
#                           evidence has been lost is no longer defensible, and
#                           this project's whole argument is "we can show you".
#   docs/design/New folder  9 MB. The superseded Stitch export. docs/design/v2
#                           replaced it and IS committed, being the spec the UI
#                           was built to.
data/
docs/design/New folder/

# Word copies of the markdown originals — regenerate with tools/md_to_docx.py
*.docx

# Loose drop folders. The design PNGs live in docs/design/v2/ under real names;
# a copy inside app/ would also sit in Vercel's root directory for no reason.
**/New folder/

# The standalone technical reference and its diagrams. Deliberately NOT in the
# repo: Raphael asked for it in the project folder only. Regenerate the .docx
# with  python tools/md_to_docx.py GreenProof_Technical_Reference.md
GreenProof_Technical_Reference.md
arch-system.png
arch-path.png
arch-scoring.png
